  using 1 OpenMP thread(s) per MPI task
package gpu 1
read_restart rst.100000000
Reading restart file ...
  restart file = 2 Aug 2023, LAMMPS = 10 Sep 2025
  restoring atom style full from restart
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (48 48 624)
